<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Health Certificate</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 12mm;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .certificate {
    max-width: 800px;
    width: calc(100% - 2px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 12px;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }
  .header-table td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 4px 8px;
  }
  .header-table .left-col {
    width: 50%;
  }
  .header-table .right-col {
    width: 50%;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .header-table .right-col img.emblem {
    height: 60px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .gov-heading {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 2px 0;
  }
  .gov-subheading {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 2px 0;
  }
  .unit-name {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin: 2px 0;
  }
  .gov-address, .gov-contact {
    font-size: 11px;
    margin: 1px 0;
  }
  .main-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .field-row {
    margin: 6px 0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .disclaimer {
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .fields-table {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .fields-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .fields-table td.label {
    width: 35%;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .fields-table td.value {
    width: 65%;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
  .certification-statement {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: justify;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .declarations-table {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .declarations-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .declarations-table td.label {
    width: 35%;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .declarations-table td.value {
    width: 65%;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
  .signature-table {
    margin-top: 80px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .signature-table td {
    width: 50%;
    text-align: center;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .signature-table .role {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="certificate">

  <table class="header-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="left-col">
        <div class="field-row"><strong>Certificate No:</strong> {{.certificate_id}}</div>
        <div class="field-row"><strong>Ref. No:</strong> {{fromReview "fcau_application_review_v1" "reference_number"}}</div>
        <div class="main-header">HEALTH CERTIFICATE IN RESPECT OF FOOD CONSIGNMENT EXPORTED</div>
      </td>
      <td class="right-col">
        <!-- Replace with the official Sri Lanka National Emblem asset (embed as a
             base64 data URI so the image renders regardless of which origin the
             populated HTML is displayed from). -->
        <img class="emblem" src="" alt="Sri Lanka National Emblem">
        <div class="gov-heading">GOVERNMENT OF SRI LANKA</div>
        <div class="gov-subheading">Ministry of Health</div>
        <div class="unit-name">FOOD CONTROL ADMINISTRATION UNIT</div>
        <div class="gov-address">385, REV. BADDEGAMA WIMALAWANSA MAWATHA COLOMBO &ndash; 10</div>
        <div class="gov-contact">Tel/ Fax: +94 11 236 8727 | http://www.health.gov.lk</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="disclaimer">
    Food Control Administration Unit of the Department of Health Services in terms of the provisions of the Food Act No. 26 of 1980 as amended by the Food (Amendment) Act No. 20 of 1991 is the body for implementation of food safety measures throughout the country and responsible for inspection and certification of imported/ exported food and matters related thereto.
  </div>

  <table class="fields-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="label">1. Name &amp; Address of Consignor</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "exporter_name"}}<br>{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "exporter_address"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">2. Name &amp; Address of Consignee</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "consignee_name"}}<br>{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "consignee_address"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">3. L/C Number and Date</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "lc_number"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">4. Name/s of the Product/s (attach list if necessary)</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "description_of_food"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">5. Name of Vessel</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "vessel_name"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">6. Container Numbers (attach list if necessary)</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "container_numbers"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">7. Type of Package, Batch Codes and Total weight</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "package_batch_weight_details"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">8. Port and Country of Loading</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "port_and_country_of_loading"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">9. Country of Destination</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "country_of_destination"}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">10. Other Declaration by Consignor</td>
      <td class="value">{{fromData "fcau_application_review_v1" "other_declarations"}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="certification-statement">
    This is to certify that the food products listed above or in the attached documents have been produced/ processed/ packed in establishments conforming to the sanitary requirements of structures, equipment and environment appropriate to the products using clean and wholesome ingredients and permitted additives employing Good Manufacturing Practices and deemed fit for human consumption consequent to verification carried out.
  </div>

  <table class="declarations-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="label">Additional Declarations</td>
      <td class="value">{{.additional_declarations}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="signature-table">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <div class="role">Authorized Officer</div>
        <div>(Food &amp; Drugs Inspector - FCAU)</div>
        <div>Date: {{today}}</div>
      </td>
      <td>
        <div class="role">Authorized Signatory</div>
        <div>(Food Control Admin. Unit)</div>
        <div>Date: {{today}}</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</div>
</body>
</html>